## Public API / Interface Additions (Deferred to Phase 4)
- [ ] Add module API namespaces:
  - `/api/payroll/*`
  - `/api/inventory/*`
  - `/api/users/*`
  - `/api/tickets/*`
  - `/api/settings/*`
  - `/api/reports/*`
  - `/api/imports/*`
  - `/api/requisitions/*`
  - `/api/audit/*`
- [ ] Add shared contracts (`PaginatedResponse<T>`, `ApiError`, `FilterQuery`, action DTOs)
- [ ] Add workflow actions (approve/reject/finalize/activate/deactivate/blacklist/export/schedule/init-month)

## Test Cases and Scenarios
- [ ] Frontend parity pass: every documented screen exists and is reachable
- [ ] Field parity pass: every documented field label/type/section is present
- [ ] Frontend flow pass: navigable page-to-page user journeys
- [ ] Integration pass (Phase 4+): real persistence for all UI actions
- [ ] Regression pass: existing Guards/Clients/Deployments flows remain stable

## Checklist Rules
1. One row per documented screen in this file.
2. Do not mark a row fully complete unless all five columns are `✅`.
3. During frontend-first phases, only `Route`, `UI Fields`, and `UX Flow` are expected to advance.
4. KPI updates are mandatory after each major merge.
